    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d83">

                <pb facs="0203" n="109" sameAs="frus:frus1896/pg109"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Tillman to Mr.
                            Olney.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1896-10-13"><hi rendition="#italic">October
                                13, 1896</hi></date>.</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 90.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to hand you herewith copy
                    of letter from Mr. St. John, arbitrator in the Santos matter, also copy of his
                    award and translation of the same. I am not yet informed whether the Government
                    of Ecuador is in receipt of copy of the award.</p>
                <p>I have, etc.;</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">James D. Tillman.</hi></signed></closer>



                <xi:include href="d83-a1.xml" xpointer="d83-a1"/>
